# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/compression-lzh.md#dynamic-code-header
# provenance: PV-0060, PV-0061, PV-0062, PV-0063, PV-0064, PV-0066, PV-0067, PV-0068, PV-0350, PV-0351, PV-0352, PV-0354, PV-0355, PV-0363, PV-0364, PV-0366, PV-0367, PV-0368, PV-0369, PV-0370, PV-0371, PV-0372, PV-0374, PV-0314
# kind: decompress
# description: One literal 0x41 in a dynamic-code block: literal/length code {0x41, 256}, two padded distance symbols, every code complete.
# derivation: Header: length 1. Bits: 0-1 count 0; 2 final 1; 3-4 type 2 = 0,1 (PV-0355); 5-9 HLIT 0 (257 lengths); 10-14 HDIST 1 (2 lengths); 15-18 HCLEN 14 (18 code-length code lengths) (PV-0366, PV-0367); 19-72 eighteen 3-bit lengths for symbols 16,17,18,0,8,7,9,6,10,5,11,4,12,3,13,2,14,1: symbols 18 and 1 get 1, the others 0 (PV-0368), so canonically symbol 1 = 0 and symbol 18 = 1 (PV-0364); literal/length lengths: 18 with 7-bit extra 54 (65 zeros), 1, 18 with extra 127 (138 zeros), 18 with extra 41 (52 zeros), 1, which is 257 lengths with 0x41 and 256 at length 1 (PV-0369, PV-0370); distance lengths 1, 1 (complete, R-LZH-4, PV-0372); then literal 0x41 = 0 and end of block = 1; 103 bits, zero fill to 104. Bytes 0x14 0x04 0x07 0x02 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x40 0xDA 0xFC 0x4F 0x41.
# expect.error: none
# expect.algorithm: lzh
# expect.uncompressed_length: 1
# expect.output_length: 1
# expect.output: 41
hex:
01 00 00 00                                       # uncompressed length, u32 LE
12                                                # algorithm byte
1F 9D                                             # magic
02                                                # byte 7
14 04 07                                          # bits 0-18: count 0, final 1, type 2, HLIT 0, HDIST 1, HCLEN 14; bits 19-23 start of code-length code lengths
02 00 00 00 00 40                                 # bits 24-71: code-length code lengths (only symbols 18 and 1 nonzero)
DA FC 4F 41                                       # bit 72: length of symbol 1; 73-98 literal/length lengths; 99-100 distance lengths; 101 literal 0x41; 102 end of block; 103 zero fill
